{"id":"832d8d672c5cd995","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-fixed-point-classification.md","title":"固定点上下界推论","display":"cor-fixed-point-classification — 固定点上下界推论","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-fixed-point-classification","aliases":["91-cor-fixed-point-classification","91-cor-fixed-point-types","91-cor-fixed-point-structure"],"display":"cor-fixed-point-classification — 固定点上下界推论","depends_on":["[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","[[91-df-maximal-fixed-point]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-fixed-point-classification"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-fixed-point-classification</span><span>91-cor-fixed-point-types</span><span>91-cor-fixed-point-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-fixed-point-classification — 固定点上下界推论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0caf6a4fb6071bd3\" href=\"?note=0caf6a4fb6071bd3\" title=\"91-thm-fixed-point-existence\">91-thm-fixed-point-existence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2bc4d1a14a37aabf\" href=\"?note=2bc4d1a14a37aabf\" title=\"91-df-maximal-fixed-point\">91-df-maximal-fixed-point</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\((L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> (完备格)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:L\\to L\">\\(J:L\\to L\\)</span> (单调算子)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\(\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\((L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> 是完备格)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\,(x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y))\">\\(\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\,(x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in L:J(x)=x\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in L:J(x)=x\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lfp}(J),\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\">\\(\\operatorname{lfp}(J),\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\\)</span> (最小、最大固定点)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}classification}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\sqsubseteq x\n\\land x\\sqsubseteq\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}classification}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\sqsubseteq x\n\\land x\\sqsubseteq\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Knaster–Tarski 定理提供固定点格及其上下界，但不会把所有固定点压缩成\n“最小、一个内在、一个外在、最大”四个元素。内在/外在是固定点的性质或\n子类，不是各自唯一的固定点。</p>\n<p>固定点个数取决于具体算子；单调性本身既不推出四个固定点，也不推出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{\\aleph_0}\">\\(2^{\\aleph_0}\\)</span> 个固定点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-fixed-point-existence","status":"resolved","id":"0caf6a4fb6071bd3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-maximal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"2bc4d1a14a37aabf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-maximal-fixed-point]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"J:L\\to L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\,(x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in L:J(x)=x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lfp}(J),\\operatorname{gfp}(J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}classification}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\sqsubseteq x\n\\land x\\sqsubseteq\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"2^{\\aleph_0}","display":false}],"bytes":1558,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["0caf6a4fb6071bd3","460308c7099a8386","2bc4d1a14a37aabf"]}